WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.860
Is that a new model from Krisna?

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:01.940
How high did that thing jump?

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:02.760
Unbelievable...

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:12.810
Rygart.

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:22.270
Is that an Athenian Golem?

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:31.260
How do I...

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:38.270
You're pretty interesting, but this is goodbye!

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:46.460
<i>I moved the legs last time.</i>

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:50.410
Damn, I forgot to change the bullets back.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.460
<i>It went back.</i>

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:57.230
<i>It took a step back when I pulled the pedal.</i>

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:00.470
<i>The pedal...</i>

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:04.590
Then I'll push it!

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:19.960
Stay back!

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.100
I'm alive.

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:03.390
I hope it's not dead.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.390
Wait...

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:07.190
If it's still alive,

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:09.120
what do I do when it wakes up?

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:24.090
How do I change direction?

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:32.140
The upper levers control my upper body...

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:38.010
How do I grab something?

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:44.920
All right.

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:47.000
Now I can hold them off for a...

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.480
Yeah, right.

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:51.530
What?

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:52.680
You're still here?

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:54.520
Hurry up and get out of here!

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:57.760
And... go call for some backup.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:05.710
Your Highness!

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:37.020
It's been a while, Hodr.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:39.880
No, King Krisna IX.

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:41.280
Zess?

00:05:42.210 --> 00:05:44.280
I'll apprehend you.

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:46.000
But before that...

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.030
Wait, Zess!

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:49.410
Rygart's inside that Golem!

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:52.790
Rygart?

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:56.920
Are you trying to buy time?

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:59.770
He can't pilot a Golem.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.150
Zess?

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:04.780
You're dropping out?!

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:10.910
Rygart, it's already a miracle that you were promoted two ranks without using magic!

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:15.830
If you quit now, you're just proving that the guys who ridiculed you were right!

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:21.020
He just doesn't have enough money.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:21.960
Don't be so hard on him.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.000
Hodr.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:57.100
If I capture you, I can end this foolish war.

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:03.150
I know you aren't the kind of man to joke,
but there's no way Rygart would be here!

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:04.350
Zess!

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:08.170
Captain Sakura, I just learned that His Majesty

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:11.720
headed to the mining site on the other side of the wall.

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:12.620
What?!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:13.950
Stop, Zess!

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.020
Zess! It's me!

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:21.130
Damn, he can't hear me.

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:38.360
Stop!

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.410
Your Highness!

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:00.910
General Baldr!

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.750
Lower your body and aim!

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:06.540
What is that movement?

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:11.460
So he uses large caliber bullets.

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:13.870
Angle your shield!

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:15.470
It'll go through if you take a straight shot!

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:18.470
Your Highness, it's great to see you're safe.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.640
Lee! Are you alive?

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:21.690
Lee!

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:22.470
Zess?

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:25.410
Good. If you can move, then make your way back.

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:26.480
Join up with Erekt.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.590
Zess, what about King Krisna?

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:32.490
I failed.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:35.730
Walls of shields?

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:36.490
We're retreating.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.930
This is a canyon.

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:41.160
If they send their units behind us, we won't stand a chance.

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:46.220
That crest...

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:48.190
It's Baldr, the great general of Krisna.

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:49.380
Lee, go now!

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:59.400
<i>We can't overwhelm them with this many units?</i>

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:01.680
<i>So that's the infamous brother.</i>

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:10.060
The enemy is retreating!

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:12.010
Don't make needless pursuit!

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:14.290
The security of His Highness is our top priority!

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.090
Zess!

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:32.120
What the hell... are you doing?

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:46.430
What an enormous bullet.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:49.270
We're taking this into Queen Sigyn's research hangar.

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:50.980
We can't, there's no room in there.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.470
Then make some immediately.

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:02.320
Rygart!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.420
Did you really fight in the Under-Golem?

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:12.490
Are you hurt?

00:10:12.490 --> 00:10:13.680
Your eyes are okay?

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:15.900
Yes, I'm fine!

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:17.220
And you know...

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:20.000
I moved that easily.

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:23.340
You were researching it, right?

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:24.890
Hodr told me.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.130
But how did you do it?

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:27.210
With my hand.

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:33.730
There's something like a small piece of
quartz in the front right part of the cockpit.

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:34.990
About here.

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:37.230
It just moved when I touched it.

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:41.780
Rygart.

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:45.040
Write me a report.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.090
'Scuse me?

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:47.870
What you did and how.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.020
As soon as possible, thanks.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:02.340
Zess.

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:05.490
I cooked dinner today.

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.380
It's seafood again.

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:09.300
Oh, thanks.

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:10.610
Just leave it there.

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:12.000
No can do!

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.010
You didn't eat yesterday when I left it next—

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:16.770
Don't disturb him, Cleo.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:21.420
Go relieve Argath from his scouting post.

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:22.430
What?

00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:23.480
I'm doing it again?

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:24.340
Why don't you do it?

00:11:24.820 --> 00:11:27.750
Oh, who said you could talk back to me?

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:30.580
Isn't being continuously active the only thing you're good at?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:39.370
Argath and I need to do a check-up on our
Eltemus' for the second strike against Binonten.

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:44.010
You don't even know how to adjust the
pressure output for the jumping mechanism.

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:47.060
Right, Miss Zero Kills Cleo?

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:53.060
I-I'm pretty useful too!

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:54.040
Really?

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:58.490
What are you proud of besides your breasts that're ridiculously large for a 12 year old?

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:00.890
The bean dish with my grandma's recipe.

00:12:00.890 --> 00:12:02.420
It's delicious!

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:03.060
So?

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:05.900
I can... do laundry.

00:12:05.900 --> 00:12:06.840
So?

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:10.030
Long-term Golem activity!

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:12.520
I can pilot a Golem for hours without feeling tired.

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:14.200
And that's exactly what I'm telling you to do!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.030
Fine!

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:25.780
Is Cleo really the one and only
daughter of the Saburafu military family?

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:27.230
Zess.

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:32.020
I'm off.

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.220
Argath, it's time to switch!

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:35.170
Keep it down!

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:36.470
You're scouting!

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:41.680
Lee, what's wrong?

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.950
U-Um...

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.730
The new Golem I saw with Krisna...

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:49.710
Its movement didn't exactly match its equipment.

00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:52.500
Oh, that odd one?

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:55.890
I'm sure it's nothing we need to worry about.

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:05.210
You'll die if you don't check properly!

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:06.190
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:07.610 --> 00:13:08.690
Let's hurry.

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:10.240
General True's waiting for us.

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:32.450
Rygart.

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:35.340
How long are you guys gonna work for?

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:40.580
I can't do anything but sleep
with the sun down, you know?

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:44.590
We're polishing non-responsive
quartz to use as this Golem's armor.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:50.480
I thought you were disassembling it because it doesn't move anymore.

00:13:50.650 --> 00:13:54.490
We can't disassemble the inner frame from the outside beyond how it currently is.

00:13:54.490 --> 00:13:57.940
With our technology, we'd only be able to destroy it.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:13:59.230
Destroy it, huh?

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:03.230
What technology did the ancients use to build this?

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.230
It's so unbalanced...

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:17.530
Unlike us, the ancients seem to have based their lives around metals

00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:20.430
which are well-suited with heat and oil.

00:14:20.430 --> 00:14:22.640
But for some reason,

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:25.890
the inner-frame is constructed of quartz which isn't exactly fit for heat or oil.

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:30.310
The exoskeleton was full of air bubbles due to corrosion,

00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:32.920
but the inner-frame isn't corroded at all.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:38.060
But if you assume they refined quartz using
inconceivable technology like the inner-frame,

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:42.120
then their technology for refining
flexible quartz was rather primitive.

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:54.090
It's as if it was created in a rush to fulfill one last duty.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.080
Earth to Sigyn.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.030
Rygart.

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:05.010
Can you rewrite your report?

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:06.590
Why?

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.540
Because this isn't a proper report.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:09.380
What's wrong with it?

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.560
It's a perfectly fine report!

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:13.190
How so?

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:14.250
Well, fine.

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:16.390
I'll write, so can you explain to me?

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:19.010
I put time into that...

00:15:19.010 --> 00:15:22.800
How did you crawl out of Mining Site 118?

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:25.480
How did you get out of the hole?

00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:27.710
Oh, I jumped.

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.370
Let's talk seriously.

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:30.900
It was at least 20 mailes deep.

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:37.070
You can't possibly jump that high without a run!

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:41.740
Even the latest, lightest Golem from Athens can only jump 10 mailes!

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:43.580
I'm serious!

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.750
Ask Hodr or the other soldiers.

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:49.750
So you're serious?

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:51.750
Yes.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.390
What about the impact when you landed?

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:56.730
Look...

00:15:56.730 --> 00:15:58.270
Just tell me how it felt.

00:15:58.270 --> 00:15:59.880
You're close.

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:00.670
Close?

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:03.770
See, if you could back up a little...

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:07.770
I can't use magic, but I'm still a man, you know...

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:16.280
Magic has nothing to do with this.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:18.010
Please redo the report.

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:18.780
I don't need any drawings.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:26.730
So this is the junk Golem that the ancients were using.

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:28.310
General True!

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:30.100
You're back?

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.480
Yes, I just returned.

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:38.430
Now that I'm here, Athens won't be doing as they please.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:41.440
We'll need more hangars than we could possibly have.

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:43.400
This is junk, isn't it?

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:45.360
Scrap it. It's taking up space.

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:46.650
My...

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:51.140
Yes, but Queen Sigyn is quite attached to it.

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:53.700
Queen Sigyn, huh?

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:55.900
Then it's out of my hands.

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:56.530
Let's go!

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:56.850
Yes, sir!

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.540
It's like a useless blade.

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:04.790
A broken blade, so to speak.

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:13.070
You hear that? They're talking shit about you.

00:17:31.140 --> 00:17:32.560
Don't take it to heart though.

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:37.980
It happened to my brother and I too.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.530
He can't pilot a Golem.

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:56.180
Zess...

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.540
You already retreated, right?

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:10.690
Hodr...

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:18.110
It doesn't look like there's anything I can do.

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:24.980
Gram?

00:18:31.050 --> 00:18:32.000
Wh...

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:34.590
What was that for?

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:05.100
Zess...

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:11.660
Krisna has around 200 Golems.

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:15.070
More than half of them have been dispersed between all of their cities for defense.

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:20.810
I'd say it's safe to assume that
around 80 Golems are in Binonten.

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:25.810
Our intention is to destroy at least 20.

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:28.460
If we can make them realize

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:32.300
that we can annihilate a quarter of the capital guards with only five Golems...

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:42.340
<i>Hodr, as wise as you are, you'll definitely surrender.</i>

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:22.240
Are they here?

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:29.470
I-It's fast!

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:39.840
We're engaged in battle at the northern gate.

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:43.050
Damn, it's not responding at all.

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.640
It was working yesterday.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:45.720
Rygart!

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:47.850
Sigyn.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:49.190
What are you doing?

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:50.220
I was explaining how it works.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.100
In any case, is Zess back?

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:56.100
Yes, I think so.

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:00.600
Why?

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:10.540
Let me do it.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:11.750
H-Hey!

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:12.960
Rygart!

00:21:13.720 --> 00:21:17.300
<i>Hodr, do you think I can do something?</i>

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:26.890
It does move!

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:28.100
What?

00:21:28.100 --> 00:21:29.830
Was it the glove?

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:32.470
I want to talk with Zess.

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:34.610
Can you ask the General to give me some time?

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:38.360
I'll talk with Zess and make him fall back.

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:40.790
I know he doesn't want this war.

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:43.740
I'm borrowing this.

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:44.680
Wait!

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:45.210
Hey!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.090
Careful!

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:55.030
<i>As I thought...</i>

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:00.970
Queen Sigyn.

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:02.970
Queen Sigyn!

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:04.990
Get General Baldr!

00:22:05.740 --> 00:22:09.840
<i>Yesterday, 30 minutes after Rygart walked away from that Golem, it lost its light.</i>

00:22:10.240 --> 00:22:13.240
<i>And it never responded to any of the pilots who tried beforehand.</i>

00:22:13.900 --> 00:22:19.340
Could it be that we, who can use magic,
aren't recognized as descendants?

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:54.220
What could've compelled you to attack Hodr's country?

00:23:55.550 --> 00:23:58.850
Not bad, cease fire negotiations.
